SUMMARY:2028 Summer Analyst Intro to Evercore
LOCATION:Julis Romo Rabinowitz Building A17
DESCRIPTION:Evercore is hosting an educational event for first-years and 
 sophomores. The session will include an overview of investment banking a
 nd a brief introduction to the firm. Students will also get to network w
 ith Evercore representatives from the New York office. The goal of the s
 ession is to introduce first-years and sophomores to the firm in advance
  of recruitment for the Summer 2028 Junior Internship program. Applicati
 ons are open from September 9\, 2026 to November 15\, 2026. Applications
  will not be reviewed on a rolling basis\; students may submit their app
 lication at any time during the application window. Please use the Everc
 ore registration form to sign up. (https://evercore.tal.net/vx/appcentre
 -ext/brand-4/spa-1/candidate/so/pm/1/pl/1/opp/3304-2028-Summer-Analyst-I
 ntro-to-Evercore-Princeton/en-GB)\nhttps://careerdevelopment.princeton.e
 du/events/2028-summer-analyst-intro-evercore
