SUMMARY:Start Your Career in Hong Kong: Talent Schemes for Future Grads
LOCATION:Center for Career Development\, Conference Room
DESCRIPTION:Hong Kong offers a unique opportunity to build international 
 experience in one of Asia’s most connected and dynamic cities. As a le
 ading international financial centre\, the city is also home to thriving
  industries in technology\, professional services\, logistics\, healthca
 re and more. After graduation\, students may be eligible to work in Hong
  Kong for at least two years under dedicated talent admission schemes 
 – without the need for prior employer sponsorship or a job offer in ad
 vance. Graduates eligible for the Top Talent Pass Scheme can explore the
  flexibility to explore different career paths\, switch jobs or even lau
 nch their own business ventures in Hong Kong. For those considering furt
 her study or research\, the info session will also cover the Hong Kong P
 hD Fellowship Scheme and other opportunities for postgraduate study in H
 ong Kong. Join representatives from the Hong Kong Economic a\nAudience: 
 Graduate Students\, Undergraduate Students\nRegister: https://app.joinha
 ndshake.com/edu/events/1999824\nhttps://careerdevelopment.princeton.edu/
 events/start-your-career-hong-kong-talent-schemes-future-grads
URL:https://careerdevelopment.princeton.edu/events/start-your-career-hong
 -kong-talent-schemes-future-grads
