DESCRIPTION:Thinking about an internship in tech\, and curious about a pa
 th in quantitative finance? Join PDT’s info session to connect with re
 cruiters and engineers. There will be an overview of the organization wh
 ere students can expect to learn about the various teams in tech and dis
 cuss Summer 2027 Tech Internships. PDT technologists willtalk about thei
 r careers\, share projects they’re currently working on\, and answer q
 uestions about tech roles in the quant finance industry. PDT engineers c
 ome from a wide variety of backgrounds\, ranging from startups and big t
 ech to well-known financial institutions. The team is always looking to 
 connect with people that value creativity\, energy and collaborative pro
 blem solving. Register to join on Thursday\, September 24th at 5:30pm. C
 atering provided. Feel free to invite friends.\nAudience: Graduate Stude
 nts\, Undergraduate Students\nhttps://careerdevelopment.princeton.edu/ev
 ents/pdt-partners-info-session-tech-internships-quant-finance-0
